<title>USA: Asahi/America Inc Q1 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Asahi/America Inc Q1 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>MALDEN, Mass. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						    March 31,</p>
<p>					     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net sales			     $ 9,123    $ 9,651</p>
<p>   Net income				378	  508</p>
<p>Net income per common and</p>
<p>   common equivalent share	    0.11	 0.22</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>common and common equivalent</p>
<p>   shares outstanding	    3,356,000  2,340,000</p>
<p>	    (dollars in thousands, except net income per share)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said revenues and earnings fell because of higher one-time expenses relating to its facility expansion and additional professional service fees, related to the due diligence of an unrealized acquisition along with an increase in operating expenses and a slowdown in dual containment sales to the military and semiconductor marketplace.</p>
<p>The company was not available to comment on the one-time expenses discussed previously.</p>
</text>
